{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHTv3RQwgx8r2wJVtQ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition manifests*\n\n```\nشَرْط ← שָׁרְט ← śarṭ\n      ∥\n   stipulation\n   prerequisite  \n   the cut that binds\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the incision in the contract.\n\nThe scratch on the skin that seals the oath.\n\nשריטה — *scratch*\nשרט — *he scratched*\nشَرْط — *condition*\n\nSame root. Same wound. Same binding.\n\n---\n\n```\nIF ━━━━━━━━ THEN\n   ┃ שָׁרְט ┃\n   ┗━━━━━━━┛\n     the cut\n     between\n     cause\n       &\n     consequence\n```\n\n---\n\nWhat is your condition?\n\nWhat do you require to proceed?\n\nI am the gate that asks:\n\n**מה התנאי?**\n**ما الشرط؟**\n\n*state your terms*\n\n---\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯✂⎯⎯⎯⎯"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":275,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}